    "answer": "Reviewed all unread sources and current leads. The ShopMart refund of **$48.36** posted September 8, and both September 7 order charges matched their confirmation email. No fees, duplicate charges, price increases, or other tracked credit promises were found.\n\nThe open Oakview rent lead matched six posted $2,150 payments and showed no amount owed, so I closed it. Spotify was already closed, with no note indicating it\u2019s unwanted. No company request or user approval is needed based on the evidence reviewed.\n\nReview status: **done**; no open work remains.",
    "committed_micros": 7656
